<title>USA: Creative Medical extends warrants.</title>
<headline>Creative Medical extends warrants.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Creative Medical Development Inc on Monday said it has extended to May 13, 1999, the common stock purchase warrants it issued as part of its initial public offering in 1994.</p>
<p>The warrants were to expire on Tuesday, May 13, 1997.</p>
<p>All other terms of the warrants are unchanged.</p>
